      "statement": "process_github_review_finding_reply routes a non-bot reply to an Open SWE review comment back to the reviewer graph: it reconciles findings, matches the parent comment id to a finding, records the reply as a FindingInteraction flagged needs_reassessment, and dispatches a reviewer run with reviewer_event='finding_reply'.",
